ed order and structure. The prompt says \"返回 JSON，按此顺序写字段：quantitative_comparisons, usable_content, decision, answers_requested_question, still_missing, read_focus, external_ask, reason.\" I will follow this exactly. `group_definitions` is mentioned in the text but not in the final field list; I'll include it inside `quantitative_comparisons` or as a top-level field if needed, but I'll stick to the explicit list. Actually, the prompt says \"缩写定义另写 group_definitions\", so I'll add it as a top-level field or within the structure. I'll place it right after `quantitative_comparisons` or as a separate key. To be safe, I'll include it as a key.\n        - Final check of the prompt: \"返回 JSON，按此顺序写字段：quantitative_comparisons（无数字则 []）, usable_content, decision, answers_requested_question（必须是 JSON boolean；不能确定或 success_criteria 未满足时填 false）, still_missing, read_focus, external_ask, reason。\" It doesn't explicitly list `group_definitions` in the final order, but says \"缩写定义另写 group_definitions\". I will add it as a key before `usable_content` or after `quantitative_comparisons`. I'll put it right after `quantitative_comparisons`.\n        - All set. \n        - Generating. \n        - [Output Generation] -> *Proceeds*","role":"assistant"}}],"created":1791889451,"id":"chatcmpl-91ff9d5b-59a4-982a-b8f2-4d5e96bc2a39","model":"qwen3.7-flash","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":5951,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":5054,"text_tokens":5951},"prompt_tokens":3340,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"text_tokens":3340},"total_tokens":9291}}